DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260911T193000
SUMMARY:Music on the River (ft. Lindy Vopnfjörð)
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\nJoin is
  in jamming to tunes from artist ***Lindy Vopnfjörð***! To book your spo
 t\, please go to the link:\n*[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/
 music-shows-on-the-river/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/mus
 ic-shows-on-the-river/)*\nLink shows live boat availability and options!\n
 \nLocated on Toronto’s beautiful Humber River our Music On The River eve
 nt starts at our Humber Paddling centre which is only a 5-Minute walk from
  Old Mill TTC Station! Upon arrival we’ll get you signed in and set you 
 up with your boat and equipment before you embark on your scenic paddle of
  the meandering Humber River before enjoying a 45-Minute set from Popular 
 Local Toronto Artists!\n\n***Events are subject to weather and other facto
 rs out of our control. If we must cancel or delay an event we will let you
  know as soon as possible.***\n\n**Booking and Pricing:**\n[https://toront
 oadventures.ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-the-river/](https://torontoad
 ventures.ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-the-river/)\nSingle Kayak (seats
  1 person) : $49.95 +taxes\nTandem Kayak (seats 2 people) : $89.95 +taxes\
 nRegular Canoe (seats 2 people) : $79.95 +taxes\nLarge Canoe (seats 3 peop
 le) : $99.95 +taxes\nStand Up Paddleboard (1 person) : $49.95 +taxes\nBrin
 g Your Own Boat (boat/equipment): $9.95 +taxes.\n\n**What's Included:**\n\
 n* Boat(s)\n* Paddle(s)\n* PFD(s) “Lifejackets”\n* A concert right on 
 the river!\n* Our experienced staff to help you every step of the way!\n\n
 **What to Bring:**\n\n* Dress for the weather!\n* Sunscreen\, Sunglasses &
  Hats\, are all recommended for sunny days!\n* We recommend securely faste
 ned footwear (footwear is not required for SUPs).\n* Blanket to keep you c
 ozy during the show\n* Snacks & Drinks (Non Alcoholic)\n* Don’t forget y
 our Cameras!\n\n**[Google Link Directions](https://torontoadventures.ca/di
 rections/#humberriverlocation)**\n**[Cancellation Policy](https://torontoa
 dventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)**[ ](https://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#can
 cellation)\n\nWe hope to see you out on the water!
